# Copy to symbols.txt and put one six-digit A-share code per line.
# Deliberately not shipped with a real list: pick your own sample so the
# numbers you publish are yours and not a copy of someone else's run.
#
# A reasonable sample spans all three prefixes, because coverage and
# adjustment behaviour differ by board:
#   60xxxx / 68xxxx  Shanghai (main board / STAR)
#   00xxxx / 30xxxx  Shenzhen (main board / ChiNext)
#   43xxxx / 83xxxx / 87xxxx  Beijing
